•	Constant updates: integrate notifications about new balance information and other important information of banking products, services, and promotions; 
•	Smart function grouping: quickly search, arrange most frequently used functions, and quickly navigate to relevant functions;
Actively make transactions: Inquiry current/term deposit account, transfer internal/local/24/7, Online saving, Bill payment, and Data top up, etc.
•	Easily manage financial status: utilize visualized diagrams and detailed table of each bank account, adjust transaction limits accordingly;
•	Enhance security: multi-leveled security method with Smart OTP, making every transaction safe and secured.

Simple steps, super attractive fee
Try BAC A BANK Mobile Banking now with only 3 steps:
1. Download/update latest version of the application
2. Login by registered Mobile phone number or CIF
3. Active Smart OTP as guided on the screen

Get more benefits from BAC A BANK:
•	Attractive Digital banking fee: free registration, free maintenance fee, free or discount interbank transfer fee, etc.;
•	Extra 0.1% interest rate per year for online deposit with minimum term of 6 months; 
•	Regular promotion campaigns for online banking.
